    "_comment": "Sunspire Saga's game data and story, ported from the legacy game.js (V48). scripts/build_sunspire_content.js turns this into the engine databases and the Tiled maps; scripts/build_walkthrough.js turns it into walkthrough.html. Numbers are the legacy ones unless a key says otherwise.",
